"Return a new write with updated fields (everything that is not None is "
"set to the new value)"
msgstr ""

#: of pwnlib.fmtstr.AtomWrite.union:1
msgid "Combine adjacent writes into a single write."
msgstr "隣り合う書き込みを 1 つの書き込みにまとめます。"

#: of pwnlib.fmtstr.AtomWrite.union:4
